  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> The ability to Shift</p><hr /><p>You master the feral power of your lycanthrope forebears. While you are shifted, choose one of the following enhancements for your unarmed attacks: they gain the <em>deadly d8</em> trait, or they gain both the <em>agile</em> and <em>finesse</em> traits.</p><p>In addition, your status bonus to Speed while shifted increases by +10 feet, and you gain low-light vision (or darkvision if you already possessed low-light vision).</p>"
